<title>USA: U.S. Alcohol Testing changes name.</title>
<headline>U.S. Alcohol Testing changes name.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Alcohol Testing of America, Inc said today that the company's name will be Substance Abuse Technologies Inc, effective Oct. 28.</p>
<p>The company's new stock symbol for trading on AMEX will be SAU for the common stock and SAU.PrA for the preferred stock also effective Oct 28.</p>
<p>The company received shareholder approval for the name at its annual meeting of shareholders held on Oct 22.</p>
